CodeQL's Actions query tests
----------------------------
testdata/corpus/globex-industries holds the .github trees of the Actions query tests in
https://github.com/github/codeql (actions/ql/test/query-tests), which
scripts/import-actions-test-fixtures.sh copies there. The SARIF test fixtures also carry the
descriptions and help of CodeQL's own queries, which CodeQL wrote into them. Both are under the
MIT License at the end of this file.

GitHub Advisory Database
------------------------
internal/advisory/testdata/advisories.json and testdata/corpus/advisories.json record four public
advisories, unmodified, as GitHub's REST API returned them. They are from the GitHub Advisory
Database, https://github.com/github/advisory-database, licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/, and
provided as is, without warranties.

